OL,3,GNEWSA'Have the time of your lives at
OL,4,ACreamfields... but just be careful'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum whose daughter was killed while
OL,7,Ftravelling to a music festival has
OL,8,Furged those attending this year's
OL,9,FCreamfields to have the "time of their
OL,10,Flives" but "just be careful".
OL,12,FDominique Williams, 20, from Maghull,
OL,13,Fdied in a car crash on Merseyside on 29
OL,14,FAugust 2009.
OL,16,FHer friend Nicola Edgar was also killed
OL,17,Fin the crash on Higher Road in Halewood
OL,18,Fwhile two others were injured.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
